sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Project repository
  participant G as GitHub App
  participant W as Cloudflare Worker
  participant A as GitHub API
  participant K as Workers KV
  participant D as Dashboard
  R->>G: Push to default branch or repository change
  G->>W: Signed webhook with delivery id
  W->>W: Limit body and verify HMAC-SHA256
  W->>A: App JWT, then request contents:read installation token
  A-->>W: Short-lived installation token
  W->>A: List repositories and read publish manifests
  A-->>W: Repository metadata and allowlisted files
  W->>W: Exclude learning, showcase, fork, archived, or invalid entries
  W->>K: Write complete schemaVersion=1 snapshot
  D->>W: GET /projects.json
  W->>K: Read latest snapshot
  K-->>D: Sanitized project cards and generatedAt
  alt Worker, GitHub, or KV unavailable
    D->>D: Keep reviewed static project index
  end
